  '<p class="gd-p">Plans change. You can ask for more days, ask to change dates, answer a change we suggest, or cancel, all from your booking.</p><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-extend-your-rental" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Extend your rental</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Extend</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Pick how long: <b class="gd-ui">1 hour</b>, <b class="gd-ui">3 hours</b>, <b class="gd-ui">1 day</b>, <b class="gd-ui">3 days</b>, <b class="gd-ui">1 week</b> or <b class="gd-ui">1 month</b>. Each shows the new return, the price with the regular price struck through, and what you save. An option the car cannot take is greyed out with the reason, and the page says until when the car is free.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Pay</b> to pay with your card on file. When the car is free it is approved at once and the page shows your new return. No card on file, or the card is declined? The secure payment page opens: enter a card there. Otherwise the request goes to our team, and once approved you pay on the same page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">For another date, open <b class="gd-ui">Another date and time</b>, choose it, press <b class="gd-ui">See the price</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Request extension</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/extend</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:960/552"><img src="/guides/img/renter-11-extend-desktop-957274cc.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="552"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:34.4%;top:62.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.1%;top:77.2%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Extending costs less than being late: a day or more is 5% off, and 1 or 3 hours are 10% off the late fee. Already past your return time and still have the car? You can still extend. It counts from your original return time, and the late charges stay owed until the extension is paid.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-ask-to-change-dates" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask to change dates</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change dates</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the new pickup and return, then press <b class="gd-ui">See the difference</b> to see what you would pay or get back.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change dates</b> to send it. Nothing changes until you agree to our answer.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/change</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:960/552"><img src="/guides/img/renter-12-change-desktop-09f6b563.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="552"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.1%;top:91.8%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-a-change-we-suggest" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A change we suggest</h2><p class="gd-p">Sometimes we need to change your booking, for example another car of the same class. You decide.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">You get an email, and your booking says &quot;We suggest a change to your booking&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Review and answer</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read what changes (before and after), the reason, the money and the time left to answer.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">To agree, press <b class="gd-ui">Accept and sign the amendment</b>, sign, then press <b class="gd-ui">Accept and sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Anything more to pay is charged to your Card on File. If the card is declined, press <b class="gd-ui">Pay and apply the change</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">To say no, press <b class="gd-ui">Decline this change</b>. Your booking stays as it was.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You have 48 hours to answer, and we send one reminder. CarmaCars signs the amendment at the moment you sign it, and the signed copy is saved under Documents. If the change costs less, the refund goes back to your card within 10 business days after the amendment is signed.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-cancel-a-booking" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Cancel a booking</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On your booking, press <b class="gd-ui">Cancel booking</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read What you get back. It shows the rule that applies and your refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the booking number to confirm (for example CC-10021), then press <b class="gd-ui">Cancel booking</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/cancel</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/renter-13-cancel-desktop-d0bb2c67.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:36.1%;top:67.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:95.8%;top:45.1%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Standard booking: when you cancel</th><th scope="col">Refund of what you paid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Within 24 hours of booking, and 48 hours or more before pickup</td><td>95% back</td></tr><tr><td>48 hours or more before pickup</td><td>75% back</td></tr><tr><td>24 to 48 hours before pickup</td><td>50% back</td></tr><tr><td>Less than 24 hours before pickup</td><td>No refund</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="gd-p">A Non-refundable booking gets no refund. The deposit is taken at pickup, so none is held when you cancel before it.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-messages-tolls-and-tickets" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Messages, tolls and tickets</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On a rental of 2 days or more we check in after the first day: &quot;How is the car?&quot; If anything is off, reply to the email or text, or call us.</li><li>Write to us about a booking at the bottom of its page: type in Your message and press Send.</li><li>Tolls and tickets are yours to pay, including Highway 407 ETR. If one reaches us, we pay it and charge the amount plus our fee to your Card on File, and email you a copy of the notice.</li><li>Running late? Extend in your booking, even after the return time while you still have the car, or call us at 289-312-5991. The late fee is 17.5% of the daily rate for each started hour (at least $25) after a 30 minute grace.</li><li>Before your return we remind you: the day before, about 3 hours before (with an Extend link) and at the return time. If the car is late we send a notice at 15 minutes and a final notice at 2 hours. No late notices between 10 pm and 7 am.</li><li>Already brought the car back but still getting late notices? Tap <b class="gd-ui">I&#39;ve returned the car</b> in the notice, or press it on your booking. Add photos of the car where you left it (pick several at once from your camera roll), the odometer, the fuel level and the time you returned it: all optional. The late notices stop at once while we check. When we confirm, your trip is complete. If we cannot find the car, we tell you why and the notices start again.</li><li>Something wrong with the car? While you have it, press <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> on your booking: it calls roadside help, or opens a message to us.</li><li>Someone else will drive too? Press <b class="gd-ui">Add a driver</b>: write their name in the message and we add them; they sign with their own link.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="during-your-trip-return-the-car-yourself-release-28" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Return the car yourself (release 28)</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Return the car yourself</b> on your booking: photos of the car where you left it, the odometer, the fuel and the time. With all of them your trip is completed at once and any late notices stop; we may still adjust the readings after we see the car.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'home-and-your-vehicles', 'chapter', 'apply-and-get-your-car-listed', 'Home tells you what to do next. Each car has its own page with its status, terms, bookings, invoices and photos.

## Home at a glance

1. The menu: Home, Cars (your cars and their bookings), Money (statements, payouts and invoices), Documents and Account (profile, banking and notifications). Each of Cars, Money and Account is one page with a row of tabs on top. Home starts with the next thing to do, then one line with what you earned so far this month, how many cars are out, the next payout and any fees due.
2. At the top: each car with its photo and its status right now (On rent, Available or In service), this month''s rental charges against last month, the next payout and the days rented this month.
3. Your earnings: a column per month. Press a month, or the arrows, for its bookings, days rented, rental charges, fees billed and the payout on its statement. Choose a car to see it alone, or **Payouts** for the statement amounts. Beside it, Money (what is due now, your fees each month, the next billing date and the next payout date) and Coming up, your next bookings.
4. Your vehicles: each car with this month so far, its next booking and what it needs next. Got another car? Press **Add a vehicle**.

![](/guides/img/owner-01-home-desktop-9035b084.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1270; address: carmacars.ca/owner; pins: 1 19.1 8.1, 2 72.9 30.7, 3 31.2 85.0")

> Tip: When something needs you (a signature, a payment or an upload), it is the first thing on Home.

## A car''s page

Open Cars, then a car.

1. The top shows the car''s photo, its plate, how it is enrolled and its status right now.
2. Terms: the Insurance Fee, the Revenue Share, your enrolment date and a link to the listing.
3. This car by month (choose a month with the arrows or its column), Coming up, and Bookings with every trip in your car. **Book it for myself** reserves it for you.
4. Leaving explains the exit notice and has the button to give it.

![](/guides/img/owner-03-vehicle-desktop-7f1a9a38.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1242; address: carmacars.ca/owner/vehicles/1f21c3e5-39c3-4d54-ae0d-cbb2512835e7; pins: 1 55.6 25.1, 2 83.3 38.0, 3 36.5 54.5, 4 81.2 67.0")

While a car is being set up, its page also shows the onboarding checklist and the uploads it still needs: the ownership permit, the lender''s permission and the insurance.

## Service and maintenance

On a car''s page, under Service and maintenance.

- What is due on your car (oil change, tires, brakes, inspections, the registration) and the tires on it.
- Every service we recorded: the date, the odometer, the shop, what was done and who paid.
- You pay for maintenance and routine wear (your agreement, 11.1). A service we paid for shows its amount and is deducted on your next statement as an owner cost.
- It is read only: call or message us about a service.

## Take new listing photos

Good photos get more bookings. You can shoot them yourself with your phone.

1. On the car''s page, press **Add listing photos** (or **Take new photos** for a car already live).
2. Read the tips for each shot: daylight, a plain background, the phone held landscape.
3. Press **Take photo** for each shot in the list. Press **Retake** if one is not right.
4. The bar shows how many required photos you have.
5. Press **Submit for listing**. New photos replace the current ones once our team approves them.

![](/guides/img/field-06-photo-shoot-capture-phone-d0b13740.jpg "phone; size: 390 610; pins: 4 92.3 43.4, 3 76.9 70.2")
