## Pickup and return records, cars you referred (release 28)

On a car''s page, **Pickup from owner and return to owner** shows the car''s condition when we picked it up from you and when we gave it back: the photos, km and fuel. If you referred another owner, **Cars** > **Cars you referred** shows their cars'' bookings, use and revenue, read only, and your referral share is a line on your statements.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Home tells you what to do next. Each car has its own page with its status, terms, bookings, invoices and photos.</p><section class="gd-task" id="home-and-your-vehicles-home-at-a-glance" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Home at a glance</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The menu: Home, Cars (your cars and their bookings), Money (statements, payouts and invoices), Documents and Account (profile, banking and notifications). Each of Cars, Money and Account is one page with a row of tabs on top. Home starts with the next thing to do, then one line with what you earned so far this month, how many cars are out, the next payout and any fees due.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">At the top: each car with its photo and its status right now (On rent, Available or In service), this month&#39;s rental charges against last month, the next payout and the days rented this month.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your earnings: a column per month. Press a month, or the arrows, for its bookings, days rented, rental charges, fees billed and the payout on its statement. Choose a car to see it alone, or <b class="gd-ui">Payouts</b> for the statement amounts. Beside it, Money (what is due now, your fees each month, the next billing date and the next payout date) and Coming up, your next bookings.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Your vehicles: each car with this month so far, its next booking and what it needs next. Got another car? Press <b class="gd-ui">Add a vehicle</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/127